  "description": "This cloth witch hat is a great addition to many different magical and fantasy scenes. The model features a classic wide brim and a tall conical crown with a drooping, curved tip. The dark grey fabric looks heavily wrinkled, giving the whole object a realistic and mysterious appearance. Around the base of the cone, there is a distinct decorative band featuring raised metallic filigree-style details in a warm bronze color.\r\n\r\nThis object fits perfectly into spooky, magical, or historical environments. You can easily place it in a dark wizard tower, an abandoned wooden cabin, or a misty autumn forest. It is also an excellent choice for Halloween scenes, mystery games, or festive holiday projects. The deep organic folds add strong character, making it ideal for creating a moody and dark atmosphere in your 3D world.",
